Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:23.29,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Those indirect tears, the tomorrow we named,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:27.46,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}And the criss-crossing lines stained future…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:32.17,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Let these innocent feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:36.47,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}And our days of laughter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.56,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Become all the more precious to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:47.44,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}You showed me many new things,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:51.61,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}Crossing the fragmented moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:57.45,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\1a&HFF&\bord6\3a&H77&\3c&H332318&\blur1}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.03,0:01:05.04,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\c&HF1F1FA&\1a&H11&\pos(960,770)}after school
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:05.04,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\b1\blur4\c&H605E85&\pos(968,778)}after school
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:08.96,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:09.75,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:10.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.71,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Morning, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:16.84,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Morning, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:20.35,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yano-san... Yoshida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:21.43,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:27.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm experiencing something I've wished for all my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.94,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.31,0:01:31.82,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What's with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:35.70,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I just get the feeling tears will start\N rolling down unless I scrunch my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:39.16,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,If we didn't know that, we'd think you were angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:41.03,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Just smile if you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:46.79,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,O-On second thought, you don't have to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.00,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,It's a little scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:51.84,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You just give off a gloomy look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:55.67,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Why don't you just try to make the best of that look, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Make... the best of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:01.05,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You bet you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:11.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He's such a nice person...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.11,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.11,Default-alt,Both,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.61,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You, too, Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:21.74,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:22.45,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,M-Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:27.96,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Wait, what's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.08,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Come on, Ryu. You should at least\N remember your classmates' names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.55,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I don't particularly stand out, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.71,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Well you do, but not in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm Kuronuma Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:39.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:39.97,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:41.34,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,I'm Sanada Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:43.51,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,I'm terrible with names.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:44.39,Default,Ryu,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:51.44,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Because Kazehaya-kun came and sat next to\N me, my surroundings have changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.56,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.40,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I still can't come up with a good name for the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.86,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you had any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:02.28,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:04.41,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:05.99,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Pedro Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:11.04,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I say, Pedro Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:11.83,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:12.71,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Pin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:15.46,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,He's only the assistant teacher! What's he doing here?
