Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.09,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,What happened to Zen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:18.67,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,He's our homeroom teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.76,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Zen's having some trouble at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:26.93,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,so I'll be here for a while as the\N pinch-hitting, bases loaded, home run hitter!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.35,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Trouble at home? Is Sadako the one behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.56,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Is it because he made her work over the summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:33.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Pedro Martinez...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.52,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Maru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.94,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:37.73,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.53,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Zen mentioned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:42.41,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:43.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.34,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,How's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.59,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Aren't I the best?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.76,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,His ego's bigger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:09.85,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,But hey, if nothing happens to Pin, it could start a good rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.60,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:13.60,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.90,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder what Pin-sensei was trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:19.32,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:20.40,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.74,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It's really hot today, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.66,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.08,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,A comedy skit, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.25,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,A skit of innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.05,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:44.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,My pulse is completely different from\N when Pin-sensei was staring into my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:48.80,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah, so then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:53.52,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Ryu and I are childhood friends, and we\N went to the same middle school as Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:58.44,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Chizu and I sat near each other since the\N first day of high school and became friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:04.61,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, has Kazehaya always been that lively?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:09.24,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's {\i1}always{\i0\fscx30} {\r} been like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.08,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,He always has to go and talk to the students who can't fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.79,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,All the guys are always crowding\N around him, and all the girls love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So he was a nice guy back during middle school, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:19.25,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:22.88,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,And so all the girls were always fighting over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:29.26,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,But then the girls realized Kazehaya probably\N didn't like that, and in the end, they came up with...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:32.26,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,...the "Kazehaya Belongs to Everyone" agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.23,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Everyone's Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:35.35,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:36.60,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,What are they, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:40.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:46.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He leaves impressions on people, moves\N them, and eventually causes them to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:48.78,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Nothing less to be expected of Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:52.66,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,He's the reason why so many girls\N from my middle school ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:55.04,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Like her, for example?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:58.00,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Yeah, like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:01.50,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Even people from other classes are coming to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I can't believe how popular he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.51,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.47,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,I need someone to stay after school to make the attendance log.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:10.47,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.97,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Isn't that {\i1}your{\i0\fscx30} {\r} job?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.18,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Quit forcing stuff on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.47,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,If Zen were here, he'd do it himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:18.10,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll pick out a volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:19.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.98,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No one wants to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.57,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll... do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:24.61,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What? That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.82,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Then I'll help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.61,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,We can get it done a lot faster if we both work on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:34.12,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Wait, if Kazehaya's doing it, I don't mind helping out either...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.58,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}everyone{\i0\fscx30} {\r} wants to do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:42.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,U-Umm... if everyone really wants to do it, then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:43.54,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.84,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You said you'd do it, so you will, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.34,0:06:49.13,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.81,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That word just came right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:06:58.23,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.56,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,What's with all this intimacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:01.94,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.56,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Stop by the faculty room later!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:05.23,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:06.65,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:08.28,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Bow.
