Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.21,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Then I'll help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That really made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:33.89,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs80\frx30\frz11.802\fax0.2\c&H3D4465&\pos(1636,434)}Kazehaya Shota
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:41.23,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Hang on! I've got to run to the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.74,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.49,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I snuck out while Pin went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.24,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'll help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:01.12,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,T-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.83,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:12.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I had a great day today because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.35,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I... didn't even do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:21.06,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Maybe everyone else is waiting for the\N right opportunity to get to know you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.52,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Mind if I use your pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:24.77,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,N-Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.98,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'll do the rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:37.28,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H50&\fnAngelina\fs100\fax-0.4\frx20\fry10\frz161.424\c&H444C60&\pos(438,428)}Kuronuma\N Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thank-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:54.68,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,First year, Class D! Kazehaya Shota!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.34,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,Come to the faculty room immediately!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:01.85,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,If you're not here in under a minute, I'll tell\N the entire school all your embarrassing stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:02.77,Default,Pin,0,0,0,,That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.39,0:09:04.98,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,K-Kuronuma, my bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.40,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'd better go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:13.40,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H50&\fnAngelina\fs100\fax-0.4\frx20\fry10\frz161.424\c&H444C60&\pos(438,428)}Kuronuma\N Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.66,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sorry, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.29,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Kazehaya was here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.46,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's Hirano-san and Endou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.33,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Maybe everyone else is waiting for the\N right opportunity to get to know you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:30.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:36.47,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-If you don't mind, can we chat for a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.22,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'll move the desks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:39.09,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I-It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:45.52,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.73,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I failed again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.15,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.77,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We can move the desks ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:57.49,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not mad at us or anything, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:09:59.74,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.16,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,It's just that Sada-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:05.70,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,I mean, Kuronuma-san, you always look kind of angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.71,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We got the impression that you like to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:14.25,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,But you were telling Yoshida-san that you were glad to be able to talk to her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:16.59,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,You were always greeting us, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:19.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We were kind of interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.34,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,Then, when we came to look, Kazehaya said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.89,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there? Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:25.39,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We'll help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.89,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,You're always doing these things by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.56,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.7\fnMistral\fs220\b1\fscx150\c&HACAC76&\pos(1744,115)\clip(1670,100,1830,176)\t(30,700,\clip(1670,100,1830,950))}T\NE\NA\NR
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:33.11,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What?! Why are you crying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.11,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-It's just that I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:37.49,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,You're kidding! Are you the "easily moved" type?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:41.70,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs60\c&H444C60&\alpha&H60&\t(4575,6010,\alpha&HFF&)\frz17.617\move(1394,63,1180,230)}Kuronuma\N Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,T-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:44.66,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, what did people used to call\N you before they started using 'Sadako'?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:47.79,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: Zashiki Warashi - A spirit resembling a young child with bobbed hair
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:47.79,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was happy when people called me "Zashiki Warashi".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.71,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That made you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.42,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Your ghost impression during that event!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:53.75,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,That was really scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:54.59,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:56.13,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I totally thought you were real!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:01.72,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Kazehaya-kun gave me the first opportunity, and after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:07.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,little by little, I feel like my surroundings started to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:12.27,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You're done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:13.65,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:16.61,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hirano-san and Endou-san helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.07,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:18.82,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:28.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Because of you, I can feel myself changing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:33.96,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You're always the one who gives me the strength to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.25,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Have you still not realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:40.01,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Yano, Yoshida, Hirano, Endou...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:43.55,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,They were all moved when they saw how hard you were trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:47.26,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,You haven't realized, yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.31,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,The one who's moving me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.73,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,...is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:55.48,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Me? Like Kazehaya-kun does for everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.40,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I never even thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:03.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But... if that was really true...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:06.66,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That would... really make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.50,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Not bad, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.55,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,So I heard you were able to open\N up to Hirano-chan and Endou-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.42,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,And they helped you out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.47,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.14,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:33.14,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,They came up and talked to me because\Nthey always see you two doing the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.69,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,T-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:37.69,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:43.45,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I think she's trying to say, "It's because you tried your best."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:46.62,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,But that's true, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.16,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I'm glad your hard work paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:56.21,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I... I'm really lucky to be able to talk with such kind people...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:59.29,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,By the way, what book is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's a book of ghost stories.
