Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.22,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Ghost stories?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:08.18,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I just thought that I may be able to live up to everyone's expectations if I read these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.01,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sadako reading ghost stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.81,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I think it'll actually be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:14.31,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You're so optimistic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:17.77,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,I can't tell if you're optimistic or just docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:23.61,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,Well, the midterm will cover everything up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:24.90,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:52.35,Default,Teach,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Kazehaya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.14,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,A bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:54.18,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I killed a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.73,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I was supposed to hand it over to Yano-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It was my first task, too...
