Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:43.90,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs100\c&H505050&\frz9.196\pos(966,555)}I'll  be  there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:44.82,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fnAngelina\fs100\c&H505050&\frz9.196\pos(968,554)}I'll  be  there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:53.45,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,My hands... were shaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:00.00,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,After I deliver these printouts to the faculty room...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.21,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,...I'll go home, change, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.42,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I got too carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:10.43,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I have to pull myself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:20.35,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:24.86,Default,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:31.03,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,She looks like a bisque doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:34.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Am I going through the greatest lucky streak of my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:43.00,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Hey! Maru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:46.04,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,M-Maru-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.05,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.93,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Maru-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:55.64,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.43,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,He was going for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:01.39,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,The bait plan worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:06.36,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Maru-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.44,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,He responded to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.78,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,What do you usually do around this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:16.24,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,S-Study, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.54,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Not before a test, I mean like, what do you do when you're bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.08,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Study, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.87,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:26.38,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I can never focus, and I always end up going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.30,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Umm... How do I put this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.84,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I sometimes daydream to pass the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.38,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean, "daydream"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.43,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I try to imagine myself in these situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:40.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,For example, I imagine that someone\N next to me doesn't understand a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Then, I think to myself:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:49.15,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,"Is this the part they don't understand?\NHow can I explain it so it's easy to understand?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:54.24,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,When I do that, I end up teaching myself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:17:01.24,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, have you told anyone about Maru yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:02.91,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:03.91,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:11.76,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,That means only you and I know about me taking him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:17.30,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Then I'm not going to tell anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:27.94,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I'm probably not the only one who's seen this smile before...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,But for now, I'm the only one watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:35.82,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I hope tomorrow will be a good day, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(814,222)}S
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(828,298)}t
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(830,348)}u
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(836,414)}d
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(842,460)}y
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(844,582)}H
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(848,634)}a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(852,704)}l
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.78,Kimi-Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\alpha&H30&\fnEraserDust\fs100\frz8\fry-10\frx15\pos(858,768)}l
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:40.78,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.37,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Could you tell me how to solve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.16,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.12,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Technically, I'm "someone next to you", too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:51.42,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,It says "nani" here. Why don't we substitute "what" for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:53.63,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Oh, this "nani" is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:55.38,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,It's used as a relational pronoun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.43,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,What, you guys are taking study hall seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:02.68,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And these two sentences are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:04.27,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,This and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:05.98,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:06.98,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Oh, wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:07.81,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:10.44,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,They're getting Sadako to tutor them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.28,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Then, you translate these two to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.82,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Wow, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.36,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Even I was able to solve this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:19.61,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,S-She was able to teach Yoshida how to solve a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.45,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You're a really good teacher, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.49,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:24.91,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:27.41,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Could you let us in on this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:29.54,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,If you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:32.17,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,You use the same formula here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.59,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:36.09,Default,Girl2,0,0,0,,I couldn't get this problem no matter how many times I tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.76,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,And if you do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.34,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Whoa, I get it now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&}PLACEHOLDER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:43.05,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,It would be awesome if she could put these up on the blackboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:41.97,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,Wow, she's really easy to understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:44.85,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:47.10,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Could you tutor us again, Kuronuma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:52.44,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I-I was able to be of some use...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:58.49,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,You're so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:16.92,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Y-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:17.71,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,You just sm-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:19.97,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:21.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.85,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,K-Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.02,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Hey, so today...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:36.98,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.28,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Your wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.90,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Everyone came to you for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:45.20,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,That made me really happy of course, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:50.62,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,My wish came true the moment\N you said you wanted me to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:54.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,So... I know you're probably tired of hearing this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.09,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,I really have to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.92,Default,Sawako,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:04.76,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yo! Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.47,0:20:08.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Huh? Is he talking to somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.68,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:12.94,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm being really selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:18.65,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was actually a little jealous because\N I used to be the only one who knew you liked to teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.70,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,So, let me keep this moment for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.57,Default,Kaze,0,0,0,,A time just for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:31.04,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Wow, that's the first time I've ever seen Sadako smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:35.50,Default,Ayane,0,0,0,,Seeing her smile like that really\N makes me think she's just a normal girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:35.50,Default-alt,Girl,0,0,0,,What?! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.67,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yoshida? The one with the really small eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:42.17,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The one who used to be a delinquent and went to juvie. {juvenile hall}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:46.26,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,And that other one, Yano. I hear she really likes guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.55,0:20:49.51,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I heard she dated a hundred guys during middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:51.52,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh! That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.52,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.69,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,So, who did you hear that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.65,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:57.73,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Who was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:00.65,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:02.61,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,E-Everyone's saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:03.95,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,That's not the answer I'm looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.20,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,I'm asking who started the rumor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:08.83,Default,Chizu,0,0,0,,Who was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:09.83,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:11.04,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Sadako.
